# Docker build context = repo root (nextjs-web / nextjs-kiosk の Coolify ビルド)。
# deny-all + allowlist で context を workspace 必要分に絞る。
*
!package.json
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!packages/
!docker-compose/nextjs-web/
!docker-compose/nextjs-kiosk/
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/generated
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
